0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 是 DeepSeek 开发的一款高性能大语言模型，该版本强调推理效率与响应速度。模型主要面向需要快速生成内容、实时对话交互以及大规模文本处理的场景，旨在在保持模型智能水平的同时，大幅提升处理吞吐量，为开发者提供高性价比的文本生成解决方案。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-24/02-recursivesi-flint.png\" alt=\"RecursiveSI/flint\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">RecursiveSI/flint</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Flint 是由 RecursiveSI 推出的模型，旨在探索大语言模型在特定垂直领域的应用能力。该模型通过优化的架构设计，能够处理复杂的逻辑推理与特定领域的知识分析任务，适合作为构建智能助手、自动化工作流或专业文档处理系统底层的核心模型，具备较强的场景适应性与扩展空间。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-24/03-black-forest-labs-flux-3-image-klein-comfy.png\" alt=\"black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">FLUX 3 Image Klein 是一款拥有 56 亿参数的开源图像模型，集成了 Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct 作为文本编码器。它不仅支持文本到图像的生成，还具备强大的图像编辑功能，支持单参考图编辑及多参考图合成任务，广泛适用于创意设计、图像处理及视觉内容生成等领域。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-24/04-openmoss-team-moss-image-sft.png\" alt=\"OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-SFT</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">MOSS-Image-SFT 是 OpenMOSS 团队推出的多模态图像理解与生成模型。该版本经过监督微调，显著提升了指令遵循能力和视觉感知精度。用户可将其应用于图像描述生成、视觉问答以及复杂的图文创意创作任务，并通过官方提供的 API 或 ComfyUI 等生态插件快速集成到开发流程中。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-24/05-lightricks-ltx-2-5.png\" alt=\"Lightricks/LTX-2.5\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Lightricks/LTX-2.5</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LTX-2.5 是由 Lightricks 开发的视觉生成模型，该模型在保持高效生成速度的同时，进一步提升了图像与视频生成的质量与连贯性。LTX-2.5 专注于通过先进的底层架构优化，增强模型对复杂视觉语义的理解，主要服务于媒体创作、数字资产生成及影视后期制作等专业领域。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeOgR45dHqS2s2kZ8KyjA65MCPMPbBBGo/0?wx_fmt=gif\" alt=\"底部引导\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section></section>",
